7. Lowest Salary Under Each Manager
SQL>SELECT MGR,
       MIN(SAL) LOWEST_SALARY
FROM EMP
WHERE MGR IS NOT NULL
GROUP BY MGR
HAVING MIN(SAL) > 2000
ORDER BY LOWEST_SALARY DESC;
-----------------------------------------------------------------
OUTPUT:-
 MGR LOWEST_SALARY
---- -------------
7839          2450
7566          2975

